{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Chill: Self-Care Sanctuary 是一款每日身心照顧應用，以一隻可愛小鳥陪伴用戶完成數分鐘的靜心練習，適合工作壓力大、睡眠欠佳，或希望培養放鬆習慣的人。程式現推出終生版限時免費，原價 US $49.99，內購限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-18.webp\">\n<h2>呼吸練習與情緒記錄</h2>\n<p>Chill 提供多種靜心練習，包括引導式呼吸、情緒記錄、紓緩音樂與環境音、睡眠追蹤及習慣養成，並加入 AI 聆聽陪伴，讓用戶隨時寫下思緒。用戶可自行組合雨聲、海浪、壁爐等音效，營造理想氛圍；亦可透過任務、等級與獎盃，將身心照顧變成日常小冒險。程式支援 Apple Watch 及 Apple Health，自動記錄靜心時段。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-89-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-90-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-91-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-92-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-93-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-94-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Chill: Self-Care Sanctuary 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Chill: Self-Care Sanctuary</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:39:38.474828+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":479,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:24:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:37.072397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:37:36.923031+00:00","content_hash":"037413c08534d4cff8e2ca360e39ec90caaa18b307c02ca67913825ee68f7cac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}